:: Day2_Afternoon_A_Redirect [day2 afternoon chloe redirect]
<<nobr>>
<p>"Chloe." I catch her wrist, gentle, and pull her hand up instead of down. "Not that. Come here."</p>

<p>She blinks. For a second I watch her recalibrate, that quick flicker behind her eyes when a plan hits a wall it didn't expect. Then she lets it go, easy as breathing, and climbs into my lap instead, straddling me, her arms looping around my neck.</p>

<p>"Fine," she says, and she's smiling, not disappointed exactly, more like a chess player conceding a single pawn. "We'll watch the rest of the movie like normal people."</p>

<p>We do. Her weight is warm against my thighs, her mouth finds mine a few times during the boring parts, unhurried, and the panties are still there under my jeans, a secret pressure I carry through the whole second act. She doesn't bring it up again today. But there's a glint in her eye when she walks me to the door, the look of someone filing this away rather than dropping it.</p>

<<dialog "Chloe" "Next time, then.">>

<<statChange "arousal" 1>>
<<statChange "resistance" 2>>
<<set $chloeRelationship += 1>>
<<spendTime 1>>
<<set $currentMapLocation to "chloe">>

